And whatever good you put forward for yourselves - you will find it with Allāh. It is better and greater in reward. And seek forgiveness of Allāh. Indeed, Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","j":29,"h":58,"s":73,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"74:1","t":"O you who covers himself [with a garment],","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"74:2","t":"Arise and warn.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"74:3","t":"And your Lord glorify.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"74:4","t":"And your clothing purify.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"74:5","t":"And uncleanliness avoid.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"74:6","t":"And do not confer favor to acquire more.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"74:7","t":"But for your Lord be patient.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"74:8","t":"And when the trumpet is blown,","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"74:9","t":"That Day will be a difficult day","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"74:10","t":"For the disbelievers - not easy.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"74:11","t":"Leave Me with the one I created alone","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"74:12","t":"And to whom I granted extensive wealth","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"74:13","t":"And children present [with him]","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"74:14","t":"And spread [everything] before him, easing [his life].","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"74:15","t":"Then he desires that I should add more.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"74:16","t":"No! Indeed, he has been toward Our verses obstinate.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"74:17","t":"I will cover him with arduous torment.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"74:18","t":"Indeed, he thought and deliberated.","j":29,"h":58,"s":74,"a":18,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":58,"surahs":[73,74],"sajdah":false}